trix $C$ is *not* a lower triangular matrix since it has a non-zero element above the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{12} & =-2\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262605 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37c4a7a7-6201-5e3d-b83c-54214a0f73f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260369} {:answer/id #uuid "5cc900a1-3450-5e9d-9935-fbf3414db9ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260670} {:answer/id #uuid "89212b5f-4485-5c4a-b4e2-c1ef65585d7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261068} {:answer/id #uuid "bebca5d9-6d1a-5817-b8da-7eabbdef4d81" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261559} {:answer/id #uuid "ffcb6a99-0bd4-51ca-8095-57e4548dde55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "E=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262118}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "37c4a7a7-6201-5e3d-b83c-54214a0f73f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260369} :answer-field/id #uuid "58d1ccae-7378-52fd-94ac-13da15be20dc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262276}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 1